/target
**/*.rs.bk

# `*.pending-snap` was here for `insta`, which is a dependency of no crate
# and is not going to become one — DECISIONS.md §4. An ignore rule for an
# artefact nothing can produce reads as a plan.

# Proprietary design docs — local only, never published
docs/

# Local permission settings, not part of the project
.claude/

# The VS Code extension's language client, installed with `npm install`
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Python bytecode, from running the scripts in `scripts/`.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
